    "text": "kqennewsradio.com\nwebsite\nRoseburg\nDRIVER CITED AFTER PICKUP REAR-ENDS SEDAN\n11 hours ago\nA driver was cited after a pickup rear-ended a sedan on Tuesday. A Roseburg Police report said at 11:00 a.m. officers responded to the two-vehicle crash near the 3400 block of Northeast Edenbower Boulevard. The investigation found that the driver of the pickup, a 36-year-old man, was reaching for his drink which had fallen on the floor, when he looked up just as his vehicle was colliding with the back of the sedan.\n1",
